          "kicker": "Player interest",
          "heading": "Jake White's arrival prompts former Wallabies star to consider Fiji switch",
          "body": "A former Wallabies star is reported to be considering a switch to Fiji, a move that follows Jake White's appointment as head coach. White was confirmed at a press conference on Tuesday, having emerged from a field of 31 applicants, and he takes over the 2027 World Cup project from interim Senirusi Seruvakula. The 62-year-old South African's brief is to get Fiji's best-prepared group to Australia, with Pool C opponents Argentina, Canada and Spain already set."
