          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Planet Rugby: Maro Itoje's back-row role could offer Steve Borthwick an option",
          "body": "Planet Rugby's round-three England winners and losers column argues that Maro Itoje's move to the back row, where he was named Player of the Match against Bristol Bears, could present Steve Borthwick with a different picture in his back five. The column also floats Alex Coles's switch to the wide forward role for Northampton as a possible idea for November, pointing to 67 metres from 10 carries and a try. George Martin and Ben Bamber are cited as further options for Borthwick."
