      "edition": "Wednesday 14 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Club injury news",
          "heading": "Stade Français's Yoan Tanga and Noah Nene injured before Bulls clash",
          "body": "Stade Français go into Saturday's Champions Cup opener at Loftus Versfeld with two more injury doubts beyond the hooker Lucas Peyresblanques. Yoan Tanga left the 30-22 Top 14 win over Montpellier after nine minutes with a rib injury, and the extent of it remains unclear. Noah Nene was replaced in the 18th minute after hurting his right ankle, and Paul Gustard, the Stade Français coach, indicated he could be sidelined for around two weeks, pending further medical examinations."
        },
