          "heading": "World Rugby failed in August bid to strike out brain injury claims",
          "body": "The Athletic reported in August that World Rugby and UK bodies lost their attempt to have the brain injury cases thrown out of court. A later Guardian report said the claimants face a £2.8m legal bill to keep the case going. Reporting so far does not single out Scottish players among the claimants, so Scotland's interest lies in how the governing body answers the case. No trial date has been reported."
