          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Mark Jones insists Tom Rogers was signed as a hybrid back",
          "body": "Ospreys head coach Mark Jones has pushed back on the idea that Ospreys back Tom Rogers is a full-back, insisting the 27-year-old was signed as a hybrid back. Rogers started on the right wing against Sharks and Lions before taking the 15 jersey against Dragons and winning man of the match, a run that keeps him in the mix for Wales coach Steve Tandy's squad. Tandy names his squad for the Nations Championship on 20 October."
