        {
          "kicker": "Coaching appointment",
          "heading": "Shaun Edwards joins Pumas as defence coach until 2027 World Cup",
          "body": "Shaun Edwards, the Englishman who left France's defence role earlier this year after helping them win three Six Nations titles, has joined Argentina's coaching staff on a deal running to the end of the 2027 World Cup in Australia, BBC Sport reported on 9 October. Edwards will first fulfil a consultancy with England's women's team before starting with the Pumas at the end of October, alongside Mario Ledesma. \"I've always admired the ability and quality of Argentine players,\" he said."
        },
